# Mobile (Flutter)

- Use feature-first architecture.
- Never embed service-role or privileged keys.
- Store auth tokens using secure storage mechanisms.
- Support resilient drafts and resilient uploads.
- Arabic RTL first.
- All operational writes go through the NestJS API.
